  '1b4f318a-2391-f20c-fbed-213eb4bff2f9', '4d2bdefe-cac2-ce93-d40d-a9e3d06f35e2', 'kubernetes-production/autoscaling', 'autoscaling', '오토스케일링: HPA·VPA·Cluster Autoscaler/Karpenter·KEDA 언제 무엇을',
