  '1947665e-6116-b5ed-913a-e3ce978d7711', '89de0301-fe25-1818-c5ab-2dd890230e21', 'realtor-brokerage-law/auction-practice-and-next', 'auction-practice-and-next', '경매·공매 실무와 매수신청대리 + 숫자 암기표 + 다음 단계',
